        <p source="#source-2721-2738">「へい、」</p>
        <p source="#source-2738-2866"><seg source="#source-2738-2741">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2741-2759"><rb>其處</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2759-2765">へ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2765-2789"><rb>一寸</rb><rt>ちよいと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2789-2792">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2792-2807"><rb>右</rb><rt>みぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2807-2810">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2810-2825"><rb>入</rb><rt>はひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2825-2831">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2831-2846"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もら</rt></ruby>ひたいな。」</p>
