        <p source="#source-8329-8535">「えゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8341-8362"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8362-8368">、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8368-8389"><rb>綺麗</rb><rt>きれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8389-8392">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8392-8410"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8410-8416">がお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8416-8431"><rb>揃</rb><rt>そろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8431-8458">ひでござりました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8458-8473"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8473-8494"><rb>新地</rb><rt>しんち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8494-8497">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8497-8527"><rb>御連中</rb><rt>ごれんぢう</rt></ruby>。」</p>
