        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-24829-25464"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24832-24862"><rb>女紅場</rb><rt>ぢよこうば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24862-24871">で、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24871-24895"><rb>師匠</rb><rt>ししやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24895-24922">さんをなさります、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24922-24934"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24934-24940">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24940-24958"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24958-24961">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24961-24976"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24976-24979">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-24979-24994"><rb>存</rb><rt>ぞん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-24994-25009">じながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25009-25033"><rb>勿體</rb><rt>もつたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25033-25042">ない、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25042-25063"><rb>引張</rb><rt>ひつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25063-25069">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25069-25099"><rb>地獄宿</rb><rt>ぢごくやど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25099-25105">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25105-25120"><rb>鮹</rb><rt>たこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25120-25123">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25123-25138"><rb>脚</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25138-25141">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25141-25156"><rb>噛</rb><rt>かじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25156-25171">りながら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25171-25195"><rb>袖崎</rb><rt>そでさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25195-25198">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-25198-25225"><rb>御新姐</rb><rt>ごしんぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-25225-25228">が</s