</ruby><seg source="#source-26280-26286">へお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26286-26298"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26298-26301">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26301-26316"><rb>遊</rb><rt>あそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26316-26334">ばしたやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26334-26346"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26346-26391">えましたものでござりますから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26391-26406"><rb>豫</rb><rt>かね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26406-26409">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26409-26442"><rb>胸充滿</rb><rt>むねいつぱい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26442-26445">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26445-26472"><rb>申譯</rb><rt>まをしわけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-26472-26481">をうか</seg><choice source="#source-26481-26487"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-26487-26508"><rb>喋舌</rb><rt>しやべ</rt></ruby>つたでござります。」</p>
