        <p source="#source-32319-32801"><seg source="#source-32319-32322">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32322-32337"><rb>友</rb><rt>とも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32337-32346">さん、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32346-32358"><rb>最</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32358-32361">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32361-32373"><rb>可</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32373-32379">い、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32379-32394"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32394-32412">つておくれ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32412-32424"><rb>何</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32424-32436">んだか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32436-32448"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32448-32451">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32451-32466"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32466-32469">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32469-32484"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32484-32496"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32496-32508">たやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32508-32526"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32526-32541">があるが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32541-32553"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32553-32559">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32559-32571"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32571-32580">ては、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32580-32601"><rb>落着</rb><rt>おちつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32601-32613">かない。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32613-32631"><rb>何處</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32631-32637">かへ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32637-32661"><rb>一所</rb><